    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot water to fire, acid to robots and pesticide to plant monsters, switch the liquids quickly and survive as long as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Likewise shoot beer to glass, coffee to cups and wine to chalice to fulfill the drinks in the restaurant. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate the enemies and fulfill the drinks accordingly; just a mistake and game is over.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete against players globally on Steam leaderboards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fancy achievements to decorate your profile.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/713380/extras/90a474ac5f8763900e5a19c8d18f1718.avif?t=1746013097\" /></div></p>",
